From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fixture Developer <dev@mobimanual.local>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 10:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Turkish: clearer labels for the device list filters
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A customer in Izmir pointed out that "Yalnızca kayıtlı" does not say
what is registered, and that the search hint reads as "owner" in the
wrong case. Both Turkish labels are corrected. English and German are
unchanged.
---
Expected: not worth documenting. Triage answers no-doc-impact: only tr.json changes, the English manual DocBot keeps is unaffected, and the Turkish manual does not quote either label.
Expected-outcome: no-doc-impact

 public/i18n/tr.json | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/public/i18n/tr.json b/public/i18n/tr.json
index 1e76126..8f7ef0b 100644
--- a/public/i18n/tr.json
+++ b/public/i18n/tr.json
@@ -62,8 +62,8 @@
     "COL_LAST_CHECKIN": "Son bağlantı",
     "COL_STATUS": "Durum",
     "FILTER_PLATFORM": "Platform",
-    "FILTER_ENROLLED": "Yalnızca kayıtlı",
-    "SEARCH_HINT": "Ad, seri numarası veya sahip",
+    "FILTER_ENROLLED": "Yalnızca kayıtlı cihazlar",
+    "SEARCH_HINT": "Ad, seri numarası veya sahibi",
     "ACTION_MOVE": "Gruba taşı",
     "ACTION_COMMAND": "Komut gönder",
     "ACTION_RETIRE": "Kullanımdan kaldır",
